     1605   ON CHOOSE OF b-sel IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1606   DO:
     1607     if ( available X_c-obj-hist ) then do:
     1608       if ( v-rid-list = "" ) or b-mark:sensitive = no
     1609       then
     1610       v-rid-list = string( recid( X_c-obj-hist ) ) .
     1611     end.
     1612   END.
     1613   ON MOUSE-SELECT-DBLCLICK OF br-obj-hist IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
