     3185       ASSIGN
     3186         sch-corr-date :POPUP-MENU in frame Dialog-Frame = MENU m-ed-date22 :HANDLE
     3187         sch-corr-date :MENU-MOUSE in frame Dialog-Frame = 3
     3188       .
