     3449   PROCEDURE disable_UI :
     3450     HIDE FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     3451   END PROCEDURE.
     3452   PROCEDURE enable_UI :
     3453     DISPLAY v-corr-user-db-num sch-db-num sch-corr-date sch-obj-code
     3454             sch-corr-user-name mark-num
     3455         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     3456     ENABLE b-quit B-mark b-sel v-corr-user-db-num B-print B-sch
     3457            B-Help br-obj-hist sch-db-num sch-corr-date sch-obj-code
     3458            sch-corr-user-name BR-changes mark-num b-nextlevel
     3459         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
